For the purposes of the identification, evaluation, management and mitigation of the risks arising from potential changes in interest rates that affect both the economic value of equity and the net interest income of an institution’s non-trading book activities, institutions shall classify the scenarios, including the supervisory shock scenarios referred to in Article 1 of Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2024/856 (
                        3
